<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-AFTERNOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 8.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-AFTERNOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 8.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here are the main headlines from the afternoon report of Lithuania's M1 Plus radio station. Reuters has not confirmed these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Presidential candidate Rimantas Smetona said on Friday Lithuania's law on refugee status, which went into effect last month, will allow too many illegal migrants to gain status as refugees and says he will propose amendments to the law.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 18</p>
